{"seq":3,"slug":"scroll-anchoring","title":"滚动锚定与跳动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/mechanics/scroll-anchoring","wordCount":1435,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"滚动锚定与跳动\">滚动锚定与跳动</h1><p><a href=\"measurement-caching\">测量与缓存</a> 末尾埋下了一个雷：窗口外的行高度只能是估算值，所以总高带误差、滚动条长度会在你滚动时随测量逐步收敛。这个收敛过程若不加干预，用户的直接感受是——正在读的内容突然往上或往下窜了一下，俗称滚动跳动（scroll jump / jank）。这一篇专讲跳动：它从哪来，以及如何用锚定补偿、<code>overflow-anchor</code> 与正确的修正时机把它彻底压平。变高方案做不做这一步，决定了它是「能用」还是「能交付」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-跳动从哪来-估算与真值的落差\">核心概念：跳动从哪来，估算与真值的落差</h2><p>想象你滚到列表中段，正在读第 500 行。此时第 100 行（在你上方、不可见）的真实高度刚被测量出来，比之前的估算值高了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mtext>px</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\text{px}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">px</span></span></span></span></span></span>。前缀和一更新，第 500 行的偏移整体下移了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mtext>px</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\text{px}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">px</span></span></span></span></span></span>，但你的 <code>scrollTop</code> 没变——于是浏览器按旧 <code>scrollTop</code> 渲染，你正读的那行瞬间跳走了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mtext>px</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\text{px}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">px</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>跳动的本质是：<strong>当前可视锚点上方的内容高度发生了变化，而滚动位置未做对应补偿</strong>。它有几个典型触发源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>上方行从估算高度被修正为真实高度（最常见）。</li>\n<li>上方插入了新行（无限滚动向上加载，见 <a href=\"../advanced/bidirectional-virtualization\">双向虚拟化</a>）。</li>\n<li>上方行内图片/字体延迟加载导致高度增大。</li>\n<li>窗口回收时，离开的行与进入的行估算/真实高度不一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[用户正读第 500 行,scrollTop 固定] --&gt; B[第 100 行真实高度被测出,比估算高 delta]&#10;  B --&gt; C[前缀和更新:500 行偏移整体 +delta]&#10;  C --&gt; D{是否补偿 scrollTop?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否,跳动| E[按旧 scrollTop 渲染,第 500 行视觉上跳走 delta]&#10;  D --&gt;|是,锚定| F[scrollTop += delta,第 500 行视觉位置不变]&#10;  F --&gt; G[用户无感,平滑]\">flowchart TD\n  A[用户正读第 500 行,scrollTop 固定] --&gt; B[第 100 行真实高度被测出,比估算高 delta]\n  B --&gt; C[前缀和更新:500 行偏移整体 +delta]\n  C --&gt; D{是否补偿 scrollTop?}\n  D --&gt;|否,跳动| E[按旧 scrollTop 渲染,第 500 行视觉上跳走 delta]\n  D --&gt;|是,锚定| F[scrollTop += delta,第 500 行视觉位置不变]\n  F --&gt; G[用户无感,平滑]</pre><h2 id=\"锚定补偿-把跳动抵消掉\">锚定补偿：把跳动抵消掉</h2><p>治本的办法是补偿：每当「锚点上方」的内容高度变化了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，就把 <code>scrollTop</code> 也加上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，让锚点在视觉上纹丝不动。算法是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>scrollTop</mtext><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>scrollTop</mtext><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>anchor</mtext></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{scrollTop}_\\text{new} = \\text{scrollTop}_\\text{old} + \\sum_{i &lt; \\text{anchor}} \\Delta h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scrollTop</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scrollTop</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">anchor</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只累加锚点<strong>上方</strong>那些行的高度变化——锚点下方的变化不影响你当前看到的位置，无需补偿。落地要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>选好锚点</strong>：通常取当前可见区顶部的第一行作为锚点，记下它的 id 与它相对视口顶部的偏移。</li>\n<li><strong>测量后立刻补偿，且在绘制前</strong>：在 <code>ResizeObserver</code> 回调批量更新前缀和的同一帧里，计算上方高度变化总量，同步写 <code>scrollTop</code>。若拖到下一帧，用户已经看到跳动了。这就是上一篇强调「在绘制前收敛」的原因。</li>\n<li><strong>区分上方/下方</strong>：用锚点索引把脏区间一分为二，只对上方部分求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\Delta h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>主流库（TanStack Virtual、react-virtuoso）内部都实现了这套补偿，这也是「手写虚拟化能跑但不丝滑、用库才丝滑」的关键差距之一（库对比见 <a href=\"../practice/virtualization-libraries\">虚拟化库选型</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"浏览器原生的-overflow-anchor\">浏览器原生的 overflow-anchor</h2><p>浏览器自身也有一套对抗跳动的机制叫<strong>滚动锚定（scroll anchoring）</strong>，由 CSS 属性 <code>overflow-anchor</code> 控制（默认 <code>auto</code>，开启）。它的原理是：浏览器自动选一个屏幕上的锚点元素，当其上方 DOM 高度变化时，自动调整滚动位置保持锚点不动——和我们手动补偿做的是同一件事，只是由浏览器代劳。</p>\n<p>但它对虚拟化是一把双刃剑：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>原生 overflow-anchor 的作用</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>spacer 占位方案、行在文档流中</td>\n<td>能自动抵消上方 spacer 高度变化导致的跳动</td>\n<td>保持开启，少写补偿代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绝对定位 / transform 摆放</td>\n<td>行不在常规文档流，锚定常失效或选错锚点</td>\n<td>不能依赖，须手动补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>你已自己做了精确补偿</td>\n<td>与手动补偿叠加，可能双重修正、过冲</td>\n<td>在滚动容器上设 <code>overflow-anchor: none</code> 关掉它</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>兼容性上需注意：<code>overflow-anchor</code> 在 Chrome、Edge、Firefox 已长期支持，但 <strong>Safari/WebKit 至今不支持</strong>——所以任何依赖原生锚定的方案，在 Safari 上都得有手动补偿兜底。这也是为什么严肃的虚拟化库不把抗跳动外包给浏览器，而是自己实现一套跨浏览器一致的补偿（来源：MDN <code>overflow-anchor</code>、caniuse css-overflow-anchor，2026 数据）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"程序化滚动的跳动-scrolltoindex\">程序化滚动的跳动：scrollToIndex</h2><p>跳动不只发生在被动滚动，也发生在你主动调用「滚动到第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 行」时。变高列表里，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 行的精确偏移依赖它上方所有行的真实高度，而那些行可能还没测量过、只有估算值。于是 <code>scrollToIndex(k)</code> 第一次跳过去往往不准，落点偏了一截。应对策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>滚后校正（scroll-and-correct）</strong>：先按估算偏移滚过去，到位后测量沿途真实高度、修正前缀和，再二次微调滚动位置，必要时迭代几次直到落点稳定。</li>\n<li><strong>锁定对齐</strong>：把目标行用 <code>align: &#39;start&#39; | &#39;center&#39;</code> 对齐，配合补偿，让用户看到的目标位置一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套程序化定位的不稳定，也是 <a href=\"../practice/virtualization-pitfalls\">虚拟化陷阱</a> 里 <code>scrollIntoView</code> 失效一条的根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跳动的本质：当前锚点上方的内容高度变了（估算修正、上方插入、图片延迟加载），而 <code>scrollTop</code> 未补偿，导致可视内容窜动。</li>\n<li>锚定补偿：把锚点上方所有行的高度变化总量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>anchor</mtext></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i&lt;\\text{anchor}} \\Delta h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">anchor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 加到 <code>scrollTop</code>，且必须在更新前缀和的同一帧、绘制前完成。</li>\n<li>原生 <code>overflow-anchor</code> 能在 spacer/文档流方案里自动抗跳，但对 transform 摆放失效、且 Safari 不支持，严肃库都自实现跨浏览器补偿；与手动补偿叠加时记得 <code>overflow-anchor: none</code>。</li>\n<li>程序化 <code>scrollToIndex</code> 在变高列表里首次落点不准，需滚后校正、迭代收敛，这也是 <code>scrollIntoView</code> 失效的根因。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>向上加载的极端跳动：<a href=\"../advanced/bidirectional-virtualization\">双向虚拟化</a></li>\n<li>谁帮你做了补偿：<a href=\"../practice/virtualization-libraries\">虚拟化库选型</a></li>\n<li>scrollIntoView 失效条目：<a href=\"../practice/virtualization-pitfalls\">虚拟化陷阱</a></li>\n<li>跨库——合成与滚动性能：<a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/compositing\">合成</a></li>\n<li>跨库——CLS 与布局偏移：<a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/foundations/core-web-vitals\">Core Web Vitals</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"滚动锚定与跳动","id":"滚动锚定与跳动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：跳动从哪来，估算与真值的落差","id":"核心概念-跳动从哪来-估算与真值的落差"},{"level":2,"text":"锚定补偿：把跳动抵消掉","id":"锚定补偿-把跳动抵消掉"},{"level":2,"text":"浏览器原生的 overflow-anchor","id":"浏览器原生的-overflow-anchor"},{"level":2,"text":"程序化滚动的跳动：scrollToIndex","id":"程序化滚动的跳动-scrolltoindex"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"测量与缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/mechanics/measurement-caching"},"next":{"title":"虚拟网格与表格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/advanced/virtual-grids-tables"}}